# Check every text file out as LF, on every platform. Without this, git hands a
# Windows working tree CRLF, and anything that compares a checked-out file byte
# for byte reports a difference that does not exist in the repository. That has
# now cost two fixes: active-scene-ban.test.ts normalizes its input by hand, and
# the command-reference drift check failed CI on windows-latest alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Unity YAML is LF natively and must stay that way regardless of the rule above.
*.unity text eol=lf
*.prefab text eol=lf
*.asset text eol=lf
*.meta text eol=lf
